    q: 'CUET vs JEE, which is better for career?',
    a: 'Neither is universally better — they lead to different kinds of careers. JEE is the only route into IITs, NITs, and IIITs for engineering, architecture, and applied technical careers, and it carries a much higher ceiling for students who are genuinely strong in Physics, Chemistry, and Maths. CUET opens admission into Delhi University, BHU, JNU, and 200-plus universities across commerce, humanities, law, management, and general science, and works better for students who want a wider set of career options. The right choice depends on whether you actually want a technical engineering career or a broader degree path, not on which exam sounds more prestigious.',
